OL,3,ALondon mayor says conviction for
OL,4,Auntaxed car was due to a scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of London Sir Sadiq Khan has been
OL,7,Fconvicted and fined in a fast-track
OL,8,Fcourt system after being accused of not
OL,9,Ftaxing a 24-year-old Nissan Micra in
OL,10,Fwhat his team has called a "scam".
OL,12,FThe Labour politician, 55, was found
OL,13,Fguilty by a magistrate last month of
OL,14,Fkeeping an unlicensed vehicle, in a
OL,15,Fcriminal prosecution brought by the
OL,16,FDVLA.
OL,18,FCourt documents show that letters
OL,19,Faddressed to the mayor about the unpaid
OL,20,Ftax bill were sent to Gordon Ramsay's
OL,21,Feast London restaurant and the car did
OL,22,Fnot belong to the mayor.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
